# Force LF line endings for source files we read byte-precisely.
# EDB's source instrumenter (crates/engine/src/instrumentation/) slices
# Solidity source at AST-reported byte offsets. CRLF would shift those
# offsets and produce a malformed instrumented source that solc rejects
# (see PR #66's Windows CI failure on `cheats_*` tests for the worked example).
*.sol text eol=lf
*.rs text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
